<title>DENMARK: Novo Nordisk to issue results March 12.</title>
<headline>Novo Nordisk to issue results March 12.</headline>
<dateline>COPENHAGEN 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Danish pharmaceuticals and biotechnology group Novo Nordisk announced on Monday it would issue its 1996 full year result on March 12.</p>
<p>Releasing better than expected 1.344 billion crown net profits for 1996's first nine months last November, Novo Nordisk upheld its earlier forecast of whole year 1996 operating and pre-tax profits 10-15 percent better than 1995.</p>
<p>In 1995, Novo posted a 2.156 billion crown pre-tax and extraordinary items profit.</p>
<p>--Chris Follett, Copenhagen newsroom +45-33969652</p>
